# ---- One-shot internal patch scripts (deliberately NOT published) ----------
# `_patch_05.py` / `_patch_08.py` were single-use scripts that edited
# `scripts/05_new_metrics.py` and `scripts/08_multiseed.py` *while a 10-seed
# production run was in flight*. Their edits are already baked into those two
# files, and the design rationale ([CHOICE] M5 concurrency metric, the
# `--trace-sat` passthrough) is recorded in the authors' provenance record.
#
# They are left on disk for traceability but are not part of the released tree:
# a reproducibility artefact should not ship a script whose whole purpose was to
# mutate another script mid-run.
_patch_05.py
_patch_08.py

# ---- Local run leftovers ---------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
